'''Pumpkinpants''' (カボチャパンツ, ''Kabochapantsu'', '''Pumpkin Pants''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after reaching [[User Rank]] 1450.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

